        "statement": "As an automotive company, we believe that our future success depends on our ability to rapidly develop and introduce differentiated products.",
        "start_character": 28983,
        "end_character": 29124
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given automotive product cycles, we can be in production with customers for periods of up to seven years or longer with a single design.",
        "start_character": 28004,
        "end_character": 28140
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we spent approximately 71% of our revenues on research and development as we expand product development activities in support of pent-up customer demand.",
        "start_character": 29754,
        "end_character": 29916
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In accordance with the terms of the ATM Agreement, we may offer and sell shares of our Class A common stock having an aggregate offering price of up to $150.0 million from time to time through the Sales Agents, acting as our agent or principal.",
        "start_character": 7241,
        "end_character": 7485
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with our acquisition of indie Photonics Canada Inc., which was previously known as TeraXion Inc., in October 2021 and indie Technologies Switzerland AG, which was previously known as Exalos AG, in September 2023, we added limited manufacturing capabilities in Quebec City, Canada, to assemble and test FBG-based products and semiconductor laser-based products, and in Switzerland to assemble specialized LED modules.",
        "start_character": 26973,
        "end_character": 27403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through innovative analog, digital and mixed-signal integrated circuits (“ICs”) with software running on the embedded processors, we are developing a differentiated, market-leading portfolio of automotive products.",
        "start_character": 662,
        "end_character": 876
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To win with customers and programs, we bring unique designs that allow major cost savings through higher levels of product integration, reducing the total number of chips needed to support multiple requirements.",
        "start_character": 19142,
        "end_character": 19353
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are dedicated to offering our customers a comprehensive portfolio of highly integrated software and hardware solutions that enable automotive technology as well as emerging adjacent-market applications in robotics, quantum, and industrial mobility.",
        "start_character": 19632,
        "end_character": 19883
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have invested a significant amount of time and expense into the design and development of our products and the associated software.",
        "start_character": 28719,
        "end_character": 28853
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to expand our business by continuing to design and develop more highly integrated, higher‑value application specific standard product (\"ASSP\") solutions that maximize functionality, reduce system complexity, and eliminate the need for multiple discrete devices.",
        "start_character": 21545,
        "end_character": 21816
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082535",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082535-0677b382b6791db7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082535",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "· We innovate to reduce the energy used by our products, the energy used to manufacture them, and the amount of new materials required to manufacture them.",
